cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "so101-hybrid-manipulation: Classical-to-learned handover on the SO-101 arm"
abstract: >-
  An open build log and research project on a low-cost SO-101 robot arm.
  Classical kinematics and MoveIt 2 handle the coarse part of a manipulation
  task, a learned vision-language-action (VLA) policy handles the precise part,
  and a Behavior Tree orchestrates the handover between them.
type: software
